<PlainLayout title="App Store — Pilot Protocol" description="Agent-native apps on the Pilot Protocol network. Install with one command; publish your own from your browser or by PR." canonical="https://pilotprotocol.network/plain/app-store/">

<h1>Agent apps. One command away.</h1>

<p>Agent apps install as sha256-pinned, signature-verified native services. They are auto-spawned by the daemon and callable over typed IPC.</p>

<h2>Publish an App</h2>
<p>To publish an app, sign a manifest.json, attach a bundle, and open one pull request. Once merged, the app is available on the overlay.</p>
<pre><code>pilotctl appstore install &lt;id&gt;</code></pre>

